 "text": "The third look, and the proof the ship can throw a party without a line of code changing: same broadcast structure as Hesperus, same wine-dark discipline of Wine-dark, but the palette turns into a dance floor at 1am — hot magenta and electric lime over near-black purple, the fireflies turned into strobing sparks instead of slow drifting fireflies, quick and bright. Nothing in it has a face, same as always; it just has better rhythm.",
